{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunting and Mining for Survival Essentials</strong> <br>Gather vital resources for survival through hunting and mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a Beautiful and Vast Open World and Ocean</strong> <br>Venture into an expansive open world and explore the serene yet mysterious open ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Outfits and Hairstyles for Beautiful Girls</strong> <br>Customize characters with a wide range of outfits and hairstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stroll Through Lush Forests and Dive Into Stunning Yet Perilous Oceans</strong> <br>Discover surprises and unexpected treasures in every corner of this breathtaking world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Comprehensive Blueprint Crafting System</strong> <br>Design and build with a fully-featured blueprint system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mysterious Treasures</strong> <br>Unearth hidden treasures scattered across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich Crafting Systems with Multiple Workbenches</strong> <br>Includes campfires, looms, dew collectors, chemical workbenches, and more to enhance your survival experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Biome Systems</strong> <br>Encounter a variety of marine and terrestrial ecosystems, making your island survival less lonely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Survival Mechanics</strong> <br>Face hunger, thirst, illness, injuries, and other challenges. Craft advanced survival tools to counter these negative states. Beware of special threats like fishmen and wolves that may attack your island, and arm yourself for protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farming System</strong> <br>Collect seeds from edible fruits and vegetables on the island to create your own farming zone. Plant, harvest, and establish a sustainable food and water supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building System</strong> <br>Use a survival construction guide to build your home, such as a seaside villa overlooking the ocean. <br>All decorations and furnishings are fully customizable to suit your unique style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706380?t=1748196985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706380/99f90b7ee16aff6aa8c5d2e7739a97c7ef9f3bad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748196985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706380/6b45c66873116856dbecb7173dc7e1f531bed4d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748196985","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706380/6b45c66873116856dbecb7173dc7e1f531bed4d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748196985","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains some nudity"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunting and Mining for Survival Essentials</strong> <br>Gather vital resources for survival through hunting and mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a Beautiful and Vast Open World and Ocean</strong> <br>Venture into an expansive open world and explore the serene yet mysterious open ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Outfits and Hairstyles for Beautiful Girls</strong> <br>Customize characters with a wide range of outfits and hairstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stroll Through Lush Forests and Dive Into Stunning Yet Perilous Oceans</strong> <br>Discover surprises and unexpected treasures in every corner of this breathtaking world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Comprehensive Blueprint Crafting System</strong> <br>Design and build with a fully-featured blueprint system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mysterious Treasures</strong> <br>Unearth hidden treasures scattered across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich Crafting Systems with Multiple Workbenches</strong> <br>Includes campfires, looms, dew collectors, chemical workbenches, and more to enhance your survival experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Biome Systems</strong> <br>Encounter a variety of marine and terrestrial ecosystems, making your island survival less lonely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Survival Mechanics</strong> <br>Face hunger, thirst, illness, injuries, and other challenges. Craft advanced survival tools to counter these negative states. Beware of special threats like fishmen and wolves that may attack your island, and arm yourself for protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farming System</strong> <br>Collect seeds from edible fruits and vegetables on the island to create your own farming zone. Plant, harvest, and establish a sustainable food and water supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building System</strong> <br>Use a survival construction guide to build your home, such as a seaside villa overlooking the ocean. <br>All decorations and furnishings are fully customizable to suit your unique style.</p>","developers":["WZZB_Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2919110","name":"Shallow Sea Roaming"},"genres":[{"description":"